{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Agent hired by Mr. Wong to help keep his suburban supermarket running\u2026 and protected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, it\u2019s business as usual stock shelves, serve customers, and keep the chaos under control, But when night falls, it\u2019s a whole different game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies emerge from the shadows, hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend yourself, the store, and the supplies from increasingly powerful waves of the Zombies.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Gameplay Features:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime Hustle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload deliveries and keep the shelves stocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle a growing swarm of customers who get more demanding each wave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance speed and efficiency to keep the supermarket running</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nighttime Survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the store from waves of hungry zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself, the supplies, and Mr. Wong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow tougher with each night</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897820/extras/39dbbe7666f0c917be46973e3fe252ae.avif?t=1761877917\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Zombie Wave survivor game, the Story is in the back-end but it is not core of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means All Updates to main Zombie Wave Survivor portion of the game will come first. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897820?t=1761877917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897820?t=1761877917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897820/d0945220bb6c8ce0a8615f3d9111b36b048314a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761877917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897820/d0945220bb6c8ce0a8615f3d9111b36b048314a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761877917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Agent hired by Mr. Wong to help keep his suburban supermarket running\u2026 and protected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, it\u2019s business as usual stock shelves, serve customers, and keep the chaos under control, But when night falls, it\u2019s a whole different game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies emerge from the shadows, hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend yourself, the store, and the supplies from increasingly powerful waves of the Zombies.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Gameplay Features:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime Hustle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload deliveries and keep the shelves stocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle a growing swarm of customers who get more demanding each wave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance speed and efficiency to keep the supermarket running</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>N